<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes<br />
<strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article<br />
<strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Horror<br />
<strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> Standard SCP Article</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Elevator&nbsp;Pitch</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;me</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> SCP-XXXX called (Midnight sun) is a:<br />
⦁ Large 45&#160;m dark quadrupedal aquatic life form ,similar in appearance to the prehistoric, mosasaurs.<br />
⦁ A Tentacle mane around the back of cranium is capable of ripping flesh and infecting through a hypodermic needle located at the tip of each tentacle.<br />
⦁ It travels at speeds = or + 400km/h and has a Strength to body to ratio of 20:1.<br />
⦁ It can only viewed at night, during viewing avoid direct eye contact with any of the 7 pupils and avoid viewing for more than 1 minute continuously. No attempts at photographing or videoing should be made.<br />
⦁ Only one image exists of SCP-XXXX, this image is a crude drawing made by a victim of SCP-XXXX.<br />
⦁ It was on the move until it was contained at the <strong>THE RING</strong><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-912760-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-912760-1')">1</a></sup> as a result of its ever increasing area of influence.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Central&nbsp;Narrative</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Close&nbsp;me</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong><br />
SCP was first alerted to the foundation through an agent located in NOAA(National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration), NOAA noticed a drastic change in salinity in an area 1km<sup>2</sup> somewhere in the Atlantic. Initial expedition by NOAA to discover source of disturbance led to complete failure and resulted in the loss of all life over a period of days. Data emitted and intercepted during time of expedition discovered: salinity in the water had changed drastically and that the underwater local flora/fauna had mutated to become highly aggressive to human life<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-912760-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-912760-2')">2</a></sup>. Upon the destruction of this first NOAA expedition the foundation decided to investigate. Initial SCP expedition to the site resulted in loss of all SCP Personnel over a period of a few days, transcripts relayed back to the foundation by the last surviving agent revealed the following:</p>
<p>1. SCP causing this anomalous event was found to be extremely aggressive and intelligent.<br />
2. All agents fell victim to the same events upon seeing the SCP: Severe/Intense Migraines, Hallucinations of past events, Inability to distinguish reality from fantasy, Anorexia/Changing of Skin tone, Pulling of hair, Gouging of eyes, Ripping of fingernails/toenails, Laceration of skin around legs, feet, forearm, face and jaw and Tooth loss.<br />
3. Transcript mentioned seeing colleagues obsessing over a crude drawing of the SCP and one agent in particular saying &quot;it has a beautiful smile&quot;.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> SCP most dangerous ability is that of of salinity conversion<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-912760-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-912760-3')">3</a></sup>, which if left uncheck can cause cataclysmic change in weather, flora/fauna, and cause an unknown chain of butterfly effects.</p>
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">Footnotes</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-912760-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-912760-1')">1</a>. A site designed specially to contain SCP-XXXX somewhere in the Atlantic</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-912760-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-912760-2')">2</a>. These two abilities occur innately and mutation is that of only being aggressive</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-912760-3"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-912760-3')">3</a>. changing the salinity of water to make it saltier or more like fresh water</div>
</div>

